%R	2547317	80279853	105917	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-08 08:10: not done</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-14 14:10: Must wait for TPO roof to be complete</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 13:10: Sleeves are installed, but collector boxes are not installed. Delay caused by incorrect grade.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-03 14:11: Progressive needs to correct crooked sections of roof in order to install downspouts</P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-10T20:24:45.181Z: Progressive corrected cricket slopes at overflow locations. Suntec, Progressive, and Layton reviewing tomorrow at 07:00am. </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-10 14:11: Will be done by end of next week. Walking 11/11, 5 days to fab, 3 days to install.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 14:11: Scupper opening changed and therefore grading height changed. </P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-18T19:15:36.945Z: Suntec needs to correct scupper and overflow dimensions. Suntec couldn't access scuppers due to BZI Crane activity on the SS of Zone 1. </P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-24T20:06:11.444Z: Crane Activity at the southside of DC1 for TES tank install is preventing Suntec from repairing Zone 1 and Zone 2 scupper dimensions. Will need to re-sequence this activity. Zone 3 first, Zone 1, then lastly Zone 2. </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-24 13:11: Close and add new line following zone 3.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-01 14:14: Delayed until crane for roof pipe moves to zone 2 on 12/5.</P><P>Chris Waddell on 2025-12-09 14:22: Need to talk to Ron before updating, will update on 12/10/25</P></BODY></HTML>
