%R	2547582	80282838	105794	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-24T20:02:37.113Z: Progressive cannot start this until PCI completes framing and sheathing of the penthouse. Current date as of now 12/5 finish for PCI. Progressive will likely start 12/8/2025. </P><P>Freddy Arrizon on 2025-11-24 13:11: PCI is delaying the penthouse sheathing and framing. There committed completion date is now 12/5/2025. Progressive will likely start install 12/8/2025 pending PCI's completion of framing, sheathing, and removing the scaffold at the penthouse. </P></BODY></HTML>
