%R	2547884	80279658	105794	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2, working on confirming when we can get this set. Pushing the ROJ out until next week until I can confirm status on curbs and roof to schedule set and when we will pull this RTU from the QAE yard.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 14:10: Need confirmation on when we can mobilize crane and curb readiness for BOH RTU. Setting FOH on 10/27, will update once confirmed date for set with MC.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-11-04 15:11: Need to determine when we are setting this, it is sitting in the QAE Yard</P><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-11-11T18:18:19.990Z: This has been postponed via dave. Dave was resequencing the RTU sets so they all get set at once. Curb wrap has been done for about 2 weeks now</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 17:11: John owes me 11/11 update</P><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-11-17 13:11: Dave W scope. Resequenced BAM to set all RTU's at once. I had Progressive wrap the RTU curb in the mean time</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-02 11:35: Waiting for TPO Roofs</P></BODY></HTML>
