%R	2548669	80281040	105323	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-10-27T14:03:46.929Z: Top track has been laid. Zone 2 is falling behind and pushing zone 3</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28T23:03:32.976Z: Unactualize this and move out to after BOH</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28 16:10: unactualize.</P><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-10-29T19:32:19.063Z: Top and bottom track has started. But, I didnt realize zone 2 was a higher priority, so labor was adjusted accordingly.</P><P>Zack Goertz on 2025-11-03T16:48:10.388Z: Zone 3 is not the priority. Zone 2 is next and is falling behind waiting for Bel-aire to finish chiller mains and REI rough in</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-04 16:11: Update needed</P></BODY></HTML>
