%R	2549346	80279658	105217	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2, working on confirming when we can get this set. Pushing the ROJ out until next week until I can confirm status on curbs and roof to schedule set and when we will pull this RTU from the QAE yard.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 14:10: Need confirmation on when we can mobilize crane and curb readiness for BOH RTU. Setting FOH on 10/27, will update once confirmed date for set with MC.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2549347	80279722	105217	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-05 15:08: Olympic West to submit the design to the city on 8/6, City review to 8/7.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-12 14:08: Fire Suppression contractor submitted the design to the city for review/approval on 8/8.</P><P>Chris Perales on 2025-09-02 12:09: Delay in getting fire pump approved by the city. City is requesting more documentation from tenant </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-21 14:10: Awaiting response</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 16:10: Waiting for feedback from city.</P></BODY></HTML>
