%R	2549771	80279649	105171	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-02 10:09: Confirmed with QTS that all RTUs (FOH/BOH) as well as all DOAS units will not be available until 9/30. QTS estimated delivery date from the vendor is 9/30.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-09-30 11:09: Pushing until end of next week 10/10 until update is received from QTS/Vendor.<br>NOTE:<br> - Follow-up mail was sent by QTS/Ali Bodur to vendor on 9/25 asking for an update on ETA and estimated delivery date for site. Pending a response as of today 9/30.<br>- J.Capriotti/Layton sent follow-up email today 9/30 to both QTS/vendor to see if we can get a response/update.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTUs were delivered to the yard with DOAS units on 10/2/2025, Working on coordinating date to set. Pushing to get these set next week 10/16, so adjusting ROJ.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 13:10: Plan is to set these on 10/27, coordinated and scheduled with QTS QAE Yard and Belaire.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2549772	80279658	105171	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-07 12:10: RTU delivered to QAE yard on 10/2, working on confirming when we can get this set. Pushing the ROJ out until next week until I can confirm status on curbs and roof to schedule set and when we will pull this RTU from the QAE yard.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-10-21 14:10: Need confirmation on when we can mobilize crane and curb readiness for BOH RTU. Setting FOH on 10/27, will update once confirmed date for set with MC.</P></BODY></HTML>
