%R	2570882	80279828	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-09-09 13:09: Terrazzo is scheduled farther out</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-09-19 11:09: Terrazzo Flooring Install at Lobby and Stairs begins on 22-December and has 4 week lead time</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-09-19 11:09: All Terrazzo Materials have a 4 week lead time</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-12-02 12:01: Terrazzo Pushed Back.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570883	80279722	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-05 15:08: Olympic West to submit the design to the city on 8/6, City review to 8/7.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-08-12 14:08: Fire Suppression contractor submitted the design to the city for review/approval on 8/8.</P><P>Chris Perales on 2025-09-02 12:09: Delay in getting fire pump approved by the city. City is requesting more documentation from tenant </P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-21 14:10: Awaiting response</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 16:10: Waiting for feedback from city.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28 16:10: Need an answer from CP</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-02 14:16: Waiting for design submittal approval</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-16 15:49: no update</P></BODY></HTML>
