%R	2570887	80282740	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-09-17 09:09: Field measurement of these doors are not scheduled until next week. </P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-12-16 12:27: OH Exterior Doors are not due onsite until Janunary </P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570888	80282744	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-10-21 12:10: OH Doors are being ordered as one package. Layton is working to breakout the Exterior from the Interior doors but all exterior have not been field verified at this time</P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-11-04 09:11: Final field verification is taking place this week for the exterior OH Doors. All OH doors are being ordered at that point</P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-11-11 08:11: Doors have not been ordered yet as we are looking at options to seperate the interior from the exterior doors for procurement</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-01 14:23: Released vendor.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570889	80282828	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-12-30 09:44: Delayed till mid January. RFI 682.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570890	80282832	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-10-21 08:10: correct start date</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-10-21 08:10: correct projected delivery date.</P><P>Jack Garrett on 2025-12-02 12:01: Case work pushed back and being stored off site.</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570891	80289990	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30 08:30: Pending delivery of last zone 2 POD (UPS Container #F12): ETA now 1/2/2026 (details below)<br>Per Trucking/Delivery Company: This POD is now tentatively set to be delivered on 1/2/2026.<br>Updates/History:<br>12/30: Truck broke down/in shop for repair. (details below)<br>Per Trucking/Delivery Company Our driver Perry is experiencing a D-Rating issue with the truck this am and does not have power. He is currently in a shop, but this will not allow us to meet our police this am to get on site this afternoon. I truly apologize for this! The goal is to get out of the shop today and we are working on police scheduling for tomorrow. I am curious what the sites schedule is the rest of the week as we try to get Perry on site as quickly as possible,<br>I will follow up the moment we are out of the shop along with the police scheduling.""<br><br>12/22: Per Trucking/Delivery Company, Pod 53075 is broke down in TX</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570892	80279654	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28 16:10: Working on crane sequencing for equipment.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-11-04 15:11: From my understanding we are waiting on a few walls to be finished, meeting tomorrow with Belaire to discuss when and how many to bring in each day.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-16 15:16: not yet</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30T15:15:54.475Z: Actualizing ROJ: DOAS delivered to QAE yard on 10/2 - technically have it just not delivered to the site from QAE yard until I can confirm set date</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2570893	80279655	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28 16:10: Working on crane sequencing for equipment.</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-11-04 15:11: Need to determine when we are setting this, it is sitting in the QAE Yard</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 17:11: John owes me 11/11 update</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-16 15:16: not yet</P><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30T15:16:01.787Z: Actualizing ROJ: DOAS delivered to QAE yard on 10/2 - technically have it just not delivered to the site from QAE yard until I can confirm set date</P></BODY></HTML>
