%R	2570895	80279650	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>John Capriotti on 2025-12-30T15:17:34.792Z: Actualizing ROJ: DOAS delivered to QAE yard on 10/2 - technically have it just not delivered to the site from QAE yard until I can confirm set date</P></BODY></HTML>
