%R	2571070	80282387	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-11 14:11: No update. Effected by RFI over conflicting shop drawings.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-18T21:06:27.628Z: Tie to TES tanks zone 3 set</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-24 13:11: Rain delay</P><P>Chris Waddell on 2025-12-09T21:06:46.927Z: Suntec installed anchor bolts by drill and epoxy today</P><P>Chris Waddell on 2025-12-09 14:10: Suntec needs to pour pedestals for stairs to sit on before they can finish.</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15T21:17:12.856Z: Pending possible RFI </P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15 14:18: Pending possible RFI</P><P>Andrew  Melis on 2025-12-30 12:46: work in progress</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2571071	80282388	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-28 14:10: OEG install telecom duct bank in area. set to be complete 10/31.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-03 14:11: Change tie between 704 and 707</P><P>Ron Carroll on 2025-12-15T21:17:34.791Z: Pending possible RFI</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2571072	80282754	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-08-26 10:08: Received update from QTS that they submitted round 4 of comments and is now expected to approve 9/5.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-07 14:10: Approval pushed again</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-21 08:10: Pushed another week.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-27 11:10: Update per Chris Perales text on 10/24/25</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-12-02 08:13: No EPCOR Approval</P></BODY></HTML>
%R	2571073	80282623	106343	236646	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode""http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=HENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1011""></HEAD><BODY><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-10-21 14:10: Moving this until after loading dock drains are complete.</P><P>Jason Johnston on 2025-11-12T00:48:42.883Z: tes tanks</P></BODY></HTML>
